      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">From older south Irving streets to Las Colinas, Irving fence jobs start with the same question: what does the City of Irving require? Get two or three written quotes from independent fence contractors.</p>
